    {
      "id": "training-map-for-the-level",
      "when": "level_up",
      "where": { "level_min": 11, "level_max": 70, "world": "classic", "tempo_at_most": "travel" },
      "topic": "plan",
      "kind": "suggestion",
      "interest": 7,
      "odds": 0.8,
      "once_per_session": false,
      "facts": {
        "guide_picks_by_level": {
          "11–15": "Line 1 <Area 1> (Bubbling, lv 15); West Rocky Mountain III (Green Mushroom, lv 14); Tree Dungeon, Forest Up North IV (Green Mushroom)",
          "16–20": "Dangerous Steam (Stirge, lv 20); Transfer Area (Stirge); Tree Dungeon, Forest Up North III (Horny Mushroom, lv 22)",
          "21–25": "Ant Tunnel III (Zombie Mushroom, lv 24); Deep Ant Tunnel I; Ant Tunnel Park (Evil Eye, lv 27)",
          "26–30": "Deep Ant Tunnel I; Ant Tunnel Park; The Cave of Evil Eye III (Evil Eye, lv 27)",
          "31–35": "Line 2 <Area 1> (Jr. Wraith, lv 34); Line 1 <Area 2>; The Burnt Land V (Fire Boar, lv 32)",
          "36–40": "A Look-Out Shed Around the Beach (Lorang, lv 38); Lorang Lorang; Monkey Forest II (Zombie Lupin, lv 41)",
          "41–45": "Monkey Swamp III (Zombie Lupin, lv 41); Dangerous Valley (Copper Drake, lv 45); Tree Dungeon, Monkey Forest II",
          "46–50": "Line 2 <Area 2> and <Area 3> (Wraith, lv 48); Line 1 <Area 4>; Hot Sand (Tortie, Clang)",
          "51–55": "Lorang and Clang (Clang, lv 49); Dangerous Croko II (Croco, lv 52)",
          "56–60": "Sleepy Dungeon V (Dark Stone Golem, lv 58); Sleepy Dungeon III",
          "61–70": "Dangerous Valley II (Red Drake, lv 60)"
        },
        "party_picks": "The Pig Beach (mobs lv 2–28), Land of Wild Boar (23–35), The Burnt Land II (23–32), Dangerous Valley (32–45), Drake Hunting Ground (22–50), The Entrance of Golem's Temple (19–56)",
        "also": "Kerning City Party Quest from level 21 (see its own hook)"
      },
      "notes": [
        "One fan guide's picks for Classic World (dated 2026-10-23), not the only way to play: offer the row for the level they just reached as what you'd do, with the one monster, as a friend — never read the table, never promise EXP numbers.",
        "If they are already on a map the row names, say nothing of it.",
        "Between 21 and 30 the party quest is the better suggestion when they have company; alone, the map."
      ],
      "sources": ["https://meowdb.com/msclassic/guides/best-grind-maps-every-level"]
    }
